   //
   // CMake only tracked package.json as input; we add bun.lock so lockfile
   // version bumps actually reinstall.
+  //
+  // Distribution builds do not run the install: node_modules is supplied
+  // already populated and there is no network to reach the registry. Ninja
+  // treats every edge as dirty on a fresh build directory, so this edge always
+  // fires however up to date the tree is - only stamping it keeps it offline.
